{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guards II: Prologue</strong> is a free turn-based tactical game with simple yet deep mechanics. Swap heroes to attack enemies, strategize several steps ahead, and claim victory in deadly combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for seven challenging missions where you\u2019ll fight through legions of hellish creatures using the amazing abilities and talents of your heroes. Protect the human world from demons and defeat the cunning boss threatening all of humanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guards II: Prologue features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 Four heroes with unique fighting styles, special attacks, super abilities, and varying resistances to damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 An original turn-based battle system where every move counts. Mistakes come at a high cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 Magical artifacts and runes that empower your team and unlock new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 Three dark biomes with a distinctive atmosphere and enemies inspired by Egyptian, Slavic, and Western European myths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694 <strong>Test your skills in Guards II: Prologue today! </strong>And don\u2019t forget to add<strong><i> the main game, Guards II: Chaos in Hell, to your Wishlist</i></strong> to continue the adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958580/extras/EN_Guards_line.png?t=1742914179\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958580/extras/Animation_arrow.gif?t=1742914179\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ADVENTURER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958580/2d04c07979d7db4b13be31920103b7151